# h8539f-arith.sinc -- arithmetic instruction family.
#
# Arithmetic instruction family: add_g/adds/sub/subs(add:q)/addx/subx/dadd/
# dsub/mulxu/divxu/cmp_g/cmp_e/cmp_i, plus the head-table swap/btst/clr/neg/
# tst/extu/exts/shal/shll/shar/shlr/rotl/rotr/rotxl/rotxr/tas family. MAP5
# forms below are not yet verified with the Sleigh compiler -- see the MAP5
# section further down.
#
# Depends on definitions still in the top-level h8539f.slaspec at time of
# writing: instr8 token (opcode/opcode47/Rd/Rs fields), special token
# (opcode_special), eab_*/eaw_* addressing subtables, Rn_banked/mode/sz
# fields (addrMode token), addr8_br/addr16_dp, op_imm4, i8/i16, CheckDivide/
# CheckOverflow8/CheckOverflow16 macros, stdflags/addflags/subflags/
# subxflags helpers. This file's @include must come after all of these are
# defined in the slim top-level file (SLEIGH lesson 1).

